<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>02 · 业务怎么用</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            专题｜复杂任务交给一个团队，而不是一个人硬扛
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
            {/* 左：编排示意 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 420, background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <svg width={340} height={260} viewBox='0 0 340 260'>
                    <rect x='110' y='14' width='120' height='52' rx='10' fill='#2563EB' />
                    <text x='170' y='46' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='16' fill='#FFFFFF' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>协调者</text>
                    <rect x='18' y='140' width='96' height='44' rx='10' fill='#E8EEFB' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                    <text x='66' y='167' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='14' fill='#1E293B' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>数据专家</text>
                    <rect x='122' y='140' width='96' height='44' rx='10' fill='#E8EEFB' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                    <text x='170' y='167' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='14' fill='#1E293B' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>文档专家</text>
                    <rect x='226' y='140' width='96' height='44' rx='10' fill='#E8EEFB' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                    <text x='274' y='167' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='14' fill='#1E293B' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>审核专家</text>
                    <line x1='170' y1='66' x2='66' y2='140' stroke='#93C5FD' strokeWidth='2' />
                    <line x1='170' y1='66' x2='170' y2='140' stroke='#93C5FD' strokeWidth='2' />
                    <line x1='170' y1='66' x2='274' y2='140' stroke='#93C5FD' strokeWidth='2' />
                    <rect x='80' y='214' width='180' height='38' rx='10' fill='#FFF7E9' stroke='#F5D9A4' strokeWidth='1.5' />
                    <text x='170' y='238' textAnchor='middle' fontSize='14' fill='#B45309' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>汇总结果 · 回到原会话</text>
                </svg>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    多步骤目标从任一入口进来，走同一条协作管线（团队编排能力持续打磨中）
                </Text>
            </Box>

            {/* 右：四点 */}
            <Box style={{ gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 96, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 12, padding: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>拆解：一次目标，多段完成</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        协调者把复杂任务拆成子目标，按专长派给不同岗位专家。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 96, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 12, padding: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>并行：互不阻塞</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        各成员在自己的会话里干活，结果回流汇总，不用等一个串一个。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 96, background: '#FFFFFF', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 12, padding: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>可见：随时插话叫停</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        按角色分条呈现进度，中途可以补充要求、修改方向或直接叫停。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 96, background: '#FFF7E9', borderRadius: 12, padding: 18 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>沉淀：流程可复用</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#7C2D12', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                        跑顺一次的协作方式可以沉淀下来，下次同类任务照着走。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 结论条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, marginTop: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                把一次性的复杂任务变成可编排、可追溯的流水线——多步骤业务才敢真正托付出去。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
